  "description": "Sometimes life can present some kind of surprises, which is amazing. And I say this because I have lived one life as a demon, and the second as a man. Now a third one is waiting for me — in the role of a Hero on the side of good. And in that world, the very first.\n\nIrony? I have been called a bastard and a psycho more than once, and here I will become a fighter for a bright future. And I, as a Former Dark Lord, have my own opinion.\n\nOriginal Webtoon\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[English (Dropped)](https://tapas.io/series/hero-with-another-opinion/info)",
